<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-003" chapter-id="c-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao" source-id="s-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao">
  <p id="c-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao:puye" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">三月甲申，尚書左僕射<persName id="c-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao:puye:m0010" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_AA">盧欽</persName>卒。辛酉，以尚書右僕射<persName id="c-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao:puye:m0023" ref="96a_987_925">山濤</persName>爲尚書左僕射。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao:situ" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">光祿大夫<persName id="c-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao:situ:m0004" ref="96a_987_925">山濤</persName>爲司徒，尚書令<persName id="c-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao:situ:m0013" ref="67b_2b2_4b8">衛瓘</persName>爲司空。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">戊午，司徒<persName id="c-jinshu-003-jin043-shantao:death:m0005" ref="96a_987_925">山濤</persName>薨。</p>
</text>
